# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5, cuda
# Minimization in a Python simulation on a GPU (D202), scenario stalled of
# Inputs/python_minimize.py: the end at a step shrunk below the floor
# (D[minimize-zero-step]), against `mdir run`.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_minimize.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU mdir %t stalled | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: GPU Double, cutoff: mdir run and the simulation stop at step
# CHECK: minimization stalled passed
